WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.600
Looking for a command? Press the question mark key to open the command palette.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:14.200
Type what you want. Every menu item, shortcut and setting is in the list.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:19.200
Press Enter to run it. Here, the Tracker opens.

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:24.800
Now the CPU. While the song plays, the toolbar's CPU meter shows the load.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.400
Double-click it for the Plugin performance monitor: the CPU of every plugin.

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:37.200
To save CPU, Tools, Switch smart disable for all plugins: a plugin rests while it is silent.
